{"version":1,"key":"card:723","content":{"id":723,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d7e5d37-1fc6-435d-a470-4d5c0f8f8a4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们常说经济有周期，其中有一个和日常商业活动最贴近的短周期，叫库存周期，也被称为基钦周期。它的核心逻辑很简单：供给与需求之间存在时间差，这个时间差导致库存不断波动，形成周期。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1010de41-04f1-41c7-b89d-d604ae40376c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举个例子，假设你在卖一个商品，有一天突然爆火了，而你没有足够多的库存，为了赚更多的钱，你决定扩大产能，比如购买设备，招更多的人，以满足需求。这个时候你的库存量会增加以满足需求量。但是天有不测风云，突然这个商品的需求下降了，而你的产能没办法马上停下来，毕竟设备已经买了，工人的工资也已经发了，这个时候库存就会急剧增加。过了一段时间，你感受到了需求的变化，决定停产，但依旧有大量的库存积压，你只能清仓大甩卖，降价去库存。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"196830a6-c545-4a9e-b33d-861492f77ae3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从这个过程中可以看出，库存周期存在四个阶段："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"92e8029d-6f81-43eb-93a8-b913ac087e1c","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"92aface0-e9b8-47d0-9fdf-4d007e22719c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f9c9467-dc2c-41ca-b8ba-612de9ae67a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"被动去库存，经济复苏期，需求突然暴涨，库存不足，由于需求暴涨带来库存减少，是一个被动的过程"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"75968074-0463-421d-838a-dc2b710c7d4a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b99b48b7-a6cf-4ae8-8fb4-76bbd533fb8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主动补库存，经济繁荣期，感受到经济向好，为了赚更多的钱，扩大产能来补充库存"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f0ed914e-f7f3-47d1-a02b-f292722ce574","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76398cd8-5e76-48ff-921c-a41455629fac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"被动补库存，经济衰退初期，需求下降，但产能还在运转，库存被动增加"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3cd8f271-9c3f-42b4-8849-1c0db2c381b3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b272fe00-4e3c-46ac-9bba-4c1fe3748dd0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主动去库存，经济衰退期，意识到寒冬已至，为了回笼资金活下去，打折促销，降价去库存"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"51435e5c-2fb9-42c2-9425-62d4676db081","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"库存周期就是实体经济的一呼一吸。理解了库存周期，你就知道当前企业是在踩油门（主动补库存）还是在踩刹车（主动去库存），从而在投资或做决策时顺应宏观经济大势。"}]}],"tags":["经济/库存周期","概念"],"createTime":1779011949485,"updateTime":1779014431513,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1779014431513}}